DTSTART:20260914T102937Z
DTEND:20260914T114321Z
SUMMARY:The Moon occults Venus
DESCRIPTION:Venus disappears at 13:32:13 and reappears at 14:40:34 EAT\, se
 en from Addis Ababa\, ET.\nThe Moon is 58° up · daylight\, Sun +71°.\nT
 imes for the Moon's mean limb\, ±2 s.\nMap\, timings and the view at the 
 Moon's edge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=9.0250&lon=38.7
 469
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=9.0250&lon=38.7469
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:The Moon occults Venus
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
